ful well remember  the Chinese are very good hosts so I  and read too much into that despite  rising trade tensions between the US and  China the Ambassador told me he thinks  China will continue to enforce the  international sanctions against North  Korea because China does not want the  north to have nuclear weapons hi Gail  thank you Ben Tracy reporting from  Beijing
 

